If you don''t know what this means, go back to your Phase 1 Day 1 workout and you''ll see it there.

From now on, if you see multiple exercises in the title (and video), then that means you will be doing those exercises in a superset.

When it comes to these supersets, I only want you to track the weight you lift on 1 exercise.

In this case, the Bent Over Row.

This renders that exercise you track to be the ''main one'', where the goal is to either lift heavier on that ''main one'' every week (or do more reps, whatever the requirement is for that week).', null, 'sltp/9375658') on conflict (id) do update set name = excluded.name, notes = excluded.notes, youtube_id = excluded.youtube_id, clip_path = coalesce(public.exercises.clip_path, excluded.clip_path), updated_at = now();

